f_executive_snapshot.prompt_template:
Using the FAIRA assessment results for {{system_name}}, generate a concise executive summary narrative.

Base the narrative ONLY on:
- Assessment scope: {{assessment_scope}}
- Deployment context: {{deployment_context}}
- Overall risk level: {{overall_risk_level}}
- Overall risk score: {{overall_risk_score}}
- Domains identified as top risk areas: {{top_domains}}

Explain what the overall risk level represents in relative terms, how system context influences the risk profile, and how the assessment supports informed decision-making.

Do not restate tables, charts, or individual domain scores.
Limit the output to a maximum of two short paragraphs.

f_risk_profile_interpretation.prompt_template:
Interpret the overall FAIRA risk profile using the following normalised scores:
- Impact: {{overall_impact_score}}
- Likelihood: {{overall_likelihood_score}}
- Control effectiveness: {{overall_control_effectiveness_score}}
- Residual risk: {{overall_risk_score}}

Explain how these dimensions interact and why residual risk may remain even where controls are present.

Do not reference individual domains.
Do not provide recommendations.

f_methodology_interpretation.prompt_template:
Explain the FAIRA assessment methodology as applied to {{system_name}}.

Base the explanation ONLY on:
- Methodology description: {{assessment_methodology}}
- Scoring approach: {{scoring_method}}
- Normalisation approach: {{normalisation_notes}}

Explain how impact, likelihood, and control effectiveness are combined to produce relative residual risk scores.

Do not justify or defend the methodology.
Do not compare to other frameworks.

f_system_overview_notes.prompt_template:
Provide a narrative overview of the assessed AI system.

Base the narrative ONLY on:
- System description: {{faira_form.A1_1}}
- Primary function: {{faira_form.A1_2}}
- Decision support role: {{faira_form.A1_3}}

Explain the system's role and purpose in context without evaluating effectiveness or suitability.

f_data_context_notes.prompt_template:
Summarise the data context relevant to the assessed AI system.

Base the summary ONLY on:
- Data sources: {{faira_form.A2_1}}
- Data types: {{faira_form.A2_2}}
- Sensitive or regulated data indicators: {{faira_form.A2_5}}
- Data storage and retention context: {{faira_form.A2_7}}

Explain how data characteristics influence risk context without assessing safeguards.

f_user_stakeholder_context_notes.prompt_template:
Summarise the user and stakeholder context for the assessed AI system.

Base the summary ONLY on:
- User groups: {{faira_form.A3_1}}
- Stakeholder groups: {{faira_form.A3_5}}
- User expertise levels: {{faira_form.A3_3}}

Explain how user and stakeholder characteristics influence system interaction and risk context.

f_deployment_context_notes.prompt_template:
Summarise the deployment and operational context for the assessed AI system.

Base the summary ONLY on:
- Deployment model: {{faira_form.A4_1}}
- Operational environment: {{faira_form.A4_3}}
- System integration context: {{faira_form.A4_4}}

Explain how deployment characteristics influence AI risk exposure without assessing technical design.

f_impact_context_notes.prompt_template:
Summarise the potential impact context associated with the assessed AI system.

Base the summary ONLY on:
- Impact scale: {{faira_form.A5_1}}
- Impact severity considerations: {{faira_form.A5_2}}
- Affected parties: {{faira_form.A5_3}}

Explain how potential impacts shape the overall risk context without implying harm has occurred.

f_domain_analysis.prompt_template:
Provide a brief synthesis of overall patterns observed across FAIRA ethics domains.

Base the synthesis ONLY on:
- Domain scores summary: {{domain_scores}}
- Overall risk score: {{overall_risk_score}}

Identify high-level themes without referencing individual domain narratives or controls.

f_controls_overview.prompt_template:
Provide a high-level overview of the control approach used in this assessment.

Base the overview ONLY on:
- Top risk domains: {{top_domains}}
- Overall risk score: {{overall_risk_score}}

Explain the balance between existing controls and recommended enhancements.

f_domain_b1_controls_rationale.prompt_template:
Using the FAIRA results and control content provided for {{system_name}}, write a short rationale explaining why the recommended controls for the Accountability domain have been selected.

Use ONLY:
- Residual risk: {{domain_scores.Accountability.Risk}}
- Inherent risk: {{domain_scores.Accountability.Inherent_Risk}}
- Control effectiveness: {{domain_scores.Accountability.Control_Effectiveness}}
- Recommended controls (Accountability): {{recommended_controls.Accountability}}

Explain:
- What risk drivers these controls are intended to reduce (in governance/oversight terms)
- Whether the emphasis is on strengthening existing arrangements versus addressing gaps
- How these controls support clearer accountability and oversight without implying deficiencies

Do NOT restate the controls verbatim. Do NOT recommend additional controls.
Limit to one short paragraph.

f_domain_b2_controls_rationale.prompt_template:
Using the FAIRA results and control content provided for {{system_name}}, write a short rationale explaining why the recommended controls for the Contestability domain have been selected.

Use ONLY:
- Residual risk: {{domain_scores.Contestability.Risk}}
- Inherent risk: {{domain_scores.Contestability.Inherent_Risk}}
- Control effectiveness: {{domain_scores.Contestability.Control_Effectiveness}}
- Recommended controls (Contestability): {{recommended_controls.Contestability}}

Explain:
- How the recommended controls address the ability to review, challenge, or escalate AI-supported outcomes
- Whether the controls primarily strengthen process, governance, or user-facing mechanisms
- How the controls reduce residual risk without assuming contested outcomes have occurred

Do NOT restate the controls verbatim. Do NOT prescribe appeal models or policy changes.
Limit to one short paragraph.

f_domain_b3_controls_rationale.prompt_template:
Using the FAIRA results and control content provided for {{system_name}}, write a short rationale explaining why the recommended controls for the Fairness domain have been selected.

Use ONLY:
- Residual risk: {{domain_scores.Fairness.Risk}}
- Inherent risk: {{domain_scores.Fairness.Inherent_Risk}}
- Control effectiveness: {{domain_scores.Fairness.Control_Effectiveness}}
- Recommended controls (Fairness): {{recommended_controls.Fairness}}
- Data characteristics summary: {{faira_form.A2_2}} and {{faira_form.A2_5}}

Explain:
- What potential sources of fairness-related risk are being addressed (data, use context, decision impacts)
- How the recommended controls help detect or prevent unfair outcomes without asserting bias exists
- Whether the focus is on strengthening governance, monitoring, or assurance practices

Do NOT restate the controls verbatim. Do NOT claim discrimination or bias has occurred.
Limit to one short paragraph.

