- Inherent risk: {{domain_scores.Values.Inherent_Risk}}
- Control effectiveness: {{domain_scores.Values.Control_Effectiveness}}
- Recommended controls (Human-Centred Values): {{recommended_controls.Values}}
- Users and stakeholders: {{faira_form.A3_1}} and {{faira_form.A3_5}}
- User expertise: {{faira_form.A3_3}}

